*charat* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''charat(string, index)''

Gets a character from a string at the specified index.

*Parameters:*
- ''string'': String to access
- ''index'': Number index position

*Returns:*
- String: Single character at the specified index

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if string is not a string
- Runtime error if index is not a number
- Runtime error if index is out of bounds
